            "speakerName": "博来",
            "text": "希望传言是假，希望岩王爷一切安康…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "101215",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "10121501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "10121501": {
            "id": "10121501",
            "speakerId": 16951,
            "speakerName": "岚姐",
            "text": "怎么？还不去找绮命吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "101216",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "10121601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "10121601": {
            "id": "10121601",
            "speakerId": 2015,
            "speakerName": "绮命",
            "text": "下次有机会的话，来码头来找我算命吧，给你优惠哦。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "101218",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "10121801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "10121801": {
            "id": "10121801",
            "speakerId": 2083,
            "speakerName": "莺儿",
            "text": "怎么，不去试试吗？难道合成台坏了？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10121802"
            ]
          },
          "10121802": {
            "id": "10121802",
            "speakerId": 2083,
            "speakerName": "莺儿",
            "text": "还是想要…请我来手把手地教导你呢？呵呵呵…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "101219",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "10121901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "10121901": {
            "id": "10121901",
            "speakerId": 2083,
            "speakerName": "莺儿",
            "text": "水取回来了吗？…没有？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "10121902"
            ]
          },
          "10121902": {
            "id": "10121902",
            "speakerId": 2083,
            "speakerName": "莺儿",
            "text": "在<color=#00E1FFFF>「万民堂」的后面</color>找找吧，卯师傅是专业的大厨，可能会存一些好水…"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
